# QA (M2, D-045): a relaxed, imperfect full run of Stage 2 at walking pace
# (handwritten, no solver prefix, never runs). Re-cut in the M2 level pass
# (Busbahnhof perch, Verkaeufer beside the stand, tourists, house roofs;
# segments after the gondolas found with a walking-only search, so it waits
# less than the original QA run: 66.4 s instead of 68 s). Busbahnhof: bumps
# the M-box from below and waits for the Mozartkugel (PowerUp), walking jump
# over the shelter wall through the Oblaten arc, hops over walker #1, climbs
# the planter's raised end (col 28) and steps off onto walker #2 (stomp),
# stomps the forecourt tourist. Talstation: waits on the station platform
# for Gondel A, rides it, waits on the knoll for Gondel B, rides it to the
# pylon, waits there for Gondel C and rides it down. Mozartplatz: lets the
# sitting Taube rise and pass, climbs the fountain rim for the arc Oblaten,
# hops over tourist #2, crosses the souvenir-stand roof and steps off onto
# the Verkaeufer (stomp, D-046), stomps tourists #3 and #4 under the
# Gastgarten and the bounce lifts Zuckerschock Resi into walker #3 on the
# Gastgarten (Hurt, back to Normal). Ischler Strasse: checkpoint, stomps
# tourist #5, bumps the M-box (Zuckerschock again), balcony route: stomps
# walker #4 on B1 and walker #5 on B2, B3, B4, bandstand roof. Seepromenade:
# waits on the bench through one note train, walks in and stomps
# Blasmusiker #2. Pier: walking jumps, stomps the jetty walker, onto the
# kiosk roof and walks off it to the pole (100). 72 of 84 Oblaten.
# Maibaum touch at frame 3984 = 66.4 s (D-045: 3 x 66.4 -> 200 s; the stage
# keeps 210 from the QA measurement of 68 s).
